flowchart LR
  U["Sam installs the GitHub App<br/>on chosen repos only"] --> GA["GitHub App<br/>short-lived tokens per operation"]
  GA --> GE["Git executor"]
  GE -- import: clone and analyse --> AN["Stack · run command · tests · agents"]
  AN --> PL["The plan from the repo<br/>parts that already work are kept"]
  PL --> BLD["Build the changed parts<br/>in the sandbox"]
  BLD -- after approval --> PR["Branch + pull request<br/>lists the plan's parts"]
  PR --> REV["Review and merge on GitHub"]
  REV -- webhook --> GE
  GE --> SYNC["Pull the merge into the sandbox<br/>re-run the affected checks"]
  POL["Governance: push to main needs an Admin"] -.-> PR
  classDef g fill:#F0EAFA,stroke:#6236AD;
  class POL g;
